isme result list bnayi jisme sare subsets store honge
ek subset list bnayi jisme particular subset bnega

n is length of array
suppose n is 3
pehli for loop chalegi 0 ; i< 8 as 1<<3 agr 1 ko 3 time left shift kia toh ayega 8

second loop chlegi j<3 
 then check krega agr i & (1<<j) 0 nhi hai toh subset bnega uska 
 otherwise traverse forward
